## 4.3 Recommend a safe lifecycle model

Based on actual findings, propose a common lifecycle governance model where appropriate.

Consider these conceptual statuses:

`DRAFT → SUBMITTED → UNDER_REVIEW → APPROVED → PUBLISHED`

